    "name": "The Serpent and the Crow",
    "steam_appid": 2818520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a0215242f4e125dbb1448eac33840319.poster.avif?t=1754055262\" width=690 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a0215242f4e125dbb1448eac33840319.webm?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a0215242f4e125dbb1448eac33840319.mp4?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/82901d46cc8e324a2c23ea2b16badd1e.webp?t=1754055262\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Serpent and the Crow is a single-player, bullet-heaven, action rogue-lite, survivor-like with strong emphasis on RPG character depth and strategic build development. Face-off against droves of enemies as you explore unique themed biomes to unlock keys and take control of ancient thrones hidden in a forgotten tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a47cd1ff51e4848f9a0bc0d02b818645.webp?t=1754055262\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/ef01458f2b5175cd1637b262abffaf59.poster.avif?t=1754055262\" width=690 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/ef01458f2b5175cd1637b262abffaf59.webm?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/ef01458f2b5175cd1637b262abffaf59.mp4?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover equipment blueprints that can be permanently crafted and upgraded at the Blacksmith. Most equipment slots will change the appearance of your character to allow for greater visual personalization. In addition, equipment can have empty rune slots (more as you upgrade). These slots can be used to temporarily augment the stats on your gear to help refine the build for that run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7b9a54a78649eb44ac7dd4f12ac9b756.webp?t=1754055262\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run will start by choosing a character Origin. This Origin will decide the starting weapon, skill, and stats of your character for the run. After completing two stages in the run you will select an Ascension for the remainder of the run. This Ascension will increase and specialize your stats. Additionally, a powerful Ascension Aura will be created around your character. Origins and Ascensions can be permanently upgraded through the Codex at your hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a38dc6d7e3dc7ede5c78b2e0bff54b8b.webp?t=1754055262\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain experience and level up during a run you will earn points to choose from a random selection of new character Traits, Skills, and Skill Modifications and enhance your strength. Tons of possible combinations of these enhancements allow each run to feel fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7df3a8631b60c60a3ec82daeabee36e5.poster.avif?t=1754055262\" width=690 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7df3a8631b60c60a3ec82daeabee36e5.webm?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7df3a8631b60c60a3ec82daeabee36e5.mp4?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/3fe8a3c86a334ed797827274014e0b70.webp?t=1754055262\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delete thousands of minions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-playability with 4 Difficulty Levels and an Endless Mode to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your strength, knowledge and dexterity against challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of skills to unlock, upgrade, and utilize in build experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from Traits, Skills, and Skill Modifications to create a uniquely powerful build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create Skill Conduits between two Skill Nodes that modify your skills even further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, collect, and upgrade gear with stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augment equipment with runes during runs to refine your build even further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Origins and Ascensions create a springboard to enhance character depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a0215242f4e125dbb1448eac33840319.poster.avif?t=1754055262\" width=690 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a0215242f4e125dbb1448eac33840319.webm?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a0215242f4e125dbb1448eac33840319.mp4?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/82901d46cc8e324a2c23ea2b16badd1e.webp?t=1754055262\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Serpent and the Crow is a single-player, bullet-heaven, action rogue-lite, survivor-like with strong emphasis on RPG character depth and strategic build development. Face-off against droves of enemies as you explore unique themed biomes to unlock keys and take control of ancient thrones hidden in a forgotten tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a47cd1ff51e4848f9a0bc0d02b818645.webp?t=1754055262\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/ef01458f2b5175cd1637b262abffaf59.poster.avif?t=1754055262\" width=690 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/ef01458f2b5175cd1637b262abffaf59.webm?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/ef01458f2b5175cd1637b262abffaf59.mp4?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover equipment blueprints that can be permanently crafted and upgraded at the Blacksmith. Most equipment slots will change the appearance of your character to allow for greater visual personalization. In addition, equipment can have empty rune slots (more as you upgrade). These slots can be used to temporarily augment the stats on your gear to help refine the build for that run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7b9a54a78649eb44ac7dd4f12ac9b756.webp?t=1754055262\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run will start by choosing a character Origin. This Origin will decide the starting weapon, skill, and stats of your character for the run. After completing two stages in the run you will select an Ascension for the remainder of the run. This Ascension will increase and specialize your stats. Additionally, a powerful Ascension Aura will be created around your character. Origins and Ascensions can be permanently upgraded through the Codex at your hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/a38dc6d7e3dc7ede5c78b2e0bff54b8b.webp?t=1754055262\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain experience and level up during a run you will earn points to choose from a random selection of new character Traits, Skills, and Skill Modifications and enhance your strength. Tons of possible combinations of these enhancements allow each run to feel fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7df3a8631b60c60a3ec82daeabee36e5.poster.avif?t=1754055262\" width=690 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7df3a8631b60c60a3ec82daeabee36e5.webm?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/7df3a8631b60c60a3ec82daeabee36e5.mp4?t=1754055262\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818520/extras/3fe8a3c86a334ed797827274014e0b70.webp?t=1754055262\" width=582 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delete thousands of minions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-playability with 4 Difficulty Levels and an Endless Mode to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your strength, knowledge and dexterity against challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of skills to unlock, upgrade, and utilize in build experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from Traits, Skills, and Skill Modifications to create a uniquely powerful build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create Skill Conduits between two Skill Nodes that modify your skills even further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, collect, and upgrade gear with stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Augment equipment with runes during runs to refine your build even further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Origins and Ascensions create a springboard to enhance character depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Serpent and the Crow is an unforgiving roguelite-survivor game. Rip through countless hordes of enemies to unlock gear, skills, origins, and ascensions and create your perfect broken build. You will need to survive to discover the mysteries of this long forgotten tavern.",
